<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nova subconta - GoatPay</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; }
        .card { background: #1e293b; padding: 24px; border-radius: 16px; width: 100%; max-width: 420px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); border: 1px solid #334155; }
        h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #fff; }
        p.desc { font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.4; }
        label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #cbd5e1; display: block; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .subtext { font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin-top: -4px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        input, select { width: 100%; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #334155; background: #0f172a; color: #fff; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; }
        input:focus, select:focus { outline: none; border-color: #22c55e; }
        .btn-criar { width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: #e2e8f0; border: none; color: #0f172a; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 15px; }
        .btn-criar:hover { background: #fff; }
        .btn-cancelar { width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid #334155; color: #94a3b8; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 15px; }
        .btn-cancelar:hover { background: #334155; color: #fff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h2>Nova subconta</h2>
        <p class="desc">Cadastre uma carteira vinculada à sua conta principal para organizar saldos e operar via API.</p>
        
        <form action="/cadastrar" method="POST">
            <label>Tipo de conta</label>
            <select name="tipo_conta">
                <option value="PF">Pessoa física (PF)</option>
                <option value="PJ">Pessoa jurídica (PJ)</option>
            </select>

            <label>Nome completo</label>
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Digite o nome completo" required>

            <label>CPF</label>
            <input type="text" name="document" placeholder="000.000.000-00" required>

            <label>Data de nascimento</label>
            <input type="date" name="birth_date" required>

            <label>CEP</label>
            <input type="text" name="cep" placeholder="00000-000" required>

            <label>Acesso ao Portal Wallet (opcional)</label>
            <p class="subtext">Informe e-mail e senha do operador. O acesso é imediato em wallet.goatpay.com.br, sem confirmação por e-mail.</p>

            <label>E-mail do operador</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="seu@email.com">

            <label>Senha (obrigatória se informar e-mail)</label>
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="••••••••">

            <button type="submit" class="btn-criar">Criar subconta</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-cancelar" onclick="alert('Cancelado')">Cancelar</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
